---
---
<section class="section cli" id="cli" aria-labelledby="cli-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Command line</span>
      <h2 id="cli-title">One command,<br />a bounded sweep.</h2>
      <p>
        Build it once, then point it at a target. The CLI is honest about what it can and can't do —
        signed inputs are refused, out-of-range values are refused, address-mode GPU is gated behind
        a clear "lands in A40+" message.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cli__panel reveal" data-cli>
      <div class="cli__head">
        <div class="cli__title">zsh — greedyfind session</div>
        <div class="cli__tabs" role="tablist">
          <button class="cli__tab is-active" data-cli-tab="pubkey" role="tab" aria-selected="true">--pubkey</button>
          <button class="cli__tab" data-cli-tab="address" role="tab" aria-selected="false">--address</button>
          <button class="cli__tab" data-cli-tab="resume" role="tab" aria-selected="false">--resume</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cli__body">
        <div class="cli__stream" data-cli-stream></div>
        <div class="cli__bar" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="cli__bar-fill"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cli__legend" aria-hidden="true">
          <span><span class="cli__legend-dot" style="background: var(--accent);"></span> prompt</span>
          <span><span class="cli__legend-dot" style="background: var(--text-muted);"></span> info</span>
          <span><span class="cli__legend-dot" style="background: var(--success);"></span> match</span>
          <span><span class="cli__legend-dot" style="background: var(--highlight);"></span> notice</span>
          <span><span class="cli__legend-dot" style="background: var(--text-faint);"></span> metadata</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="banner reveal" data-delay="2">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01" />
        <path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z" />
      </svg>
      <span>
        Educational and research use only. <code>greedy-find</code> searches a bounded, known range
        — it is not a wallet, signer, or keyspace scanner. See
        <a href="https://github.com/sachncs/greedy-find/blob/main/DISCLAIMER.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent);">DISCLAIMER.md</a>
        and the security threat model before use.
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>